# =====================================================================
# HTTP Client File for Discount Service (Loyalty & Ranks) Demo
# Supported by Visual Studio & VS Code REST Client Extension
# =====================================================================

@DiscountApiUrl = http://localhost:5048
@AliceGuid = 22ae9d28-c095-4142-b493-5f0946fc94ee

### 1. Retrieve All Loyalty Records (Debug Endpoint)
# Shows all user GUIDs, accumulated spending, and loyalty ranks currently in PostgreSQL.
GET {{DiscountApiUrl}}/api/v1/discount?customerId=debug_all&orderAmount=0
Accept: application/json

### 2. Query Alice's Loyalty Status & Discount (100$ Order)
# Alice is currently VIP (30% discount). On a 100$ order, she saves 30$ and pays 70$.
GET {{DiscountApiUrl}}/api/v1/discount?customerId={{AliceGuid}}&orderAmount=100
Accept: application/json

### 3. Query Alice's Loyalty Status & Discount (500$ Order)
# On a larger 500$ order, she saves 150$ and pays 350$.
GET {{DiscountApiUrl}}/api/v1/discount?customerId={{AliceGuid}}&orderAmount=500
Accept: application/json

### 4. Query Bob's Status (Default / Unregistered)
# Returns rank NOR (0% discount) as Bob has not completed a checkout yet.
# Note: Replace 'bob' with Bob's actual GUID from Request #1 once Bob checkouts.
GET {{DiscountApiUrl}}/api/v1/discount?customerId=bob&orderAmount=100
Accept: application/json
